{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2023-03-15 09:15:00', 'title': "ETHISPHERE NAMES JOHNSON CONTROLS AS ONE OF THE WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES FOR THE 16TH YEAR", 'text': "CORK, IRELAND , MARCH 15, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JOHNSON CONTROLS (NYSE: JCI), THE GLOBAL LEADER FOR SMART, HEALTHY, AND SUSTAINABLE BUILDINGS, HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED BY ETHISPHERE AS ONE OF THE WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES IN 2023, MARKING THE 16TH TIME JOHNSON CONTROLS HAS BEEN NAMED TO THIS LIST. THE 2023 LIST RECOGNIZED 135 HONOREES SPANNING 19 COUNTRIES AND 48 INDUSTRIES."}